o step by step:.\n\nUnits: 0 +2 =2.\n\nTens:0 +0 =0.\n\nHundreds:7 +5 =12. Write down 2, carryover 1.\n\nThousands place: 1 (from 91700) +5 (from 5502) =6, plus the carried 1 makes 7.\n\nTen-thousands place: 9 remains. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
