  212 \\times 900 = 190800\n   \\]\n\nNext, we sum all the results from the steps above:\n\\[\n1272 + 2120 + 190800\n\\]\n\nFirst, add the results of the first two steps:\n\\[\n1272 + 2120 = 3392\n\\]\n\nThen, add this result to the third step:\n\\[\n3392 + 190800 = 194192\n\\]\n\nThus, the final product of 212 and 916 is \\(\\boxed{194192}\\).",
