together: 480,000 + 34,800 equals 514,800. Let me confirm another way. 858 * 6 is 5,148, so multiplying by 100 gives 514,800. Yep, that matches.\n\nNow, I have to add all three results together: 3,432 (from the ones place), 17,160 (from the tens place), and 514,800 (from the hundreds place). Let me add the first two first. 3,432 + 17,160 equals 20,592. Then add that to 514,800. 514,800 + 20,592. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
