ct of 217 and 945 is 205,065.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe product of 217 and 945 is \\boxed{205065}.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of 217 and 945, we break down the multiplication step by step using the place values of 945 (hundreds, tens, and ones):\n\n1. **Multiply 217 by the ones place digit (5):**\n   \\[\n   217 \\times 5 = 1085\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 217 by the tens place digit (40):**\n   \\[\n   217 \\times 40 = 217 \\times 4 \\times 10 = 868 \\times 10 = 8680\n   \\]\n\n3. **Multiply 217 by the hundreds place digit (900):**\n   \\[\n   217 \\times 900 = 217 \\times 9 \\times 100 = 1953 \\times 100 = 195300\n   \\]\n\nNext, we sum the results of these three steps:\n\\[\n1085 + 8680 + 195300\n\\]\n\nFirst, add 1085 and 8680:\n\\[\n1085 + 8680 = 9765\n\\]\n\nThen, add the result to 195300:\n\\[\n9765 + 195300 = 205065\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 217 and 945 is \\(\\boxed{205065}\\).",
