t's correct. Therefore, the product of 622 and 314 is 195,308.\n\nWait, but let me check with another method, like the lattice method or the standard algorithm vertically:\n\nLet me try the standard vertical multiplication:\n\n       622  \n     × 314  \n     --------\n        2488   (622 × 4)  \n       6220    (622 × 1, shifted one position to the left)  \n     186600    (622 × 3, shifted two positions to the left)  \n     ---------\n     195308  \n\nYes, adding those three lines:\n\n2488  \n+6220 → total 8708  \n+186600 → 8708 +186600 = 195,308. Yep, same.\n\nAlright, so all methods point to 195,308. I think that's solid. Therefore, the answer should be 195,308.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe product of 622 and 314 is \\boxed{195308}.\n"]
