o the answer should be 764,048.\n\nWait, but let me check once more step by step. Let me write it down as if doing the multiplication vertically:\n\n     901\n×   848\n--------\nFirst, multiply by 8 (ones place):\n901 × 8 = 7,208\n\nThen multiply by 40 (tens place). So 901 × 4 = 3,604, then add a zero: 36,040\n\nThen multiply by 800 (hundreds place). 901 × 8 = 7,208, then add two zeros: 720,800\n\nAdding all three:\n\n7,208\n\n36,040\n\n720,800\n\nAdding the first two: 7,208 + 36,040 = 43,248\n\n43,248 + 720,800 = 764,048. Yep, that's correct.\n\nSo the final answer is 764,048. I think that's solid. I don't see any mistakes in the steps. The cross-verification with breaking down 901 into 900+1 also gave the same result. So confident it's correct.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe product of 901 and 848 is \\boxed{764048}.\n"]
