5,000\n\n415,000 +4,000 =419,000\n\n419,000 +12,800 =431,800\n\n431,800 +480 =432,280\n\n432,280 +128 =432,408. Same result. So that's correct.\n\nTherefore, the product is 432,408.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe product of 516 and 838 is \\boxed{432408}.\n"]
