ults:**\n   \\[\n   1902 + 28530 + 285300 = 315732\n   \\]\n   Verification using the distributive property:\n   \\[\n   317 \\times 996 = 317 \\times (1000 - 4) = 317000 - 1268 = 315732\n   \\]\n\nThus, the final product of 317 and 996 is \\(\\boxed{315732}\\).",
