ame result.\n\n317*1000 is 317,000. 317*4 is 1,268. So subtracting: 317,000 - 1,268 = 315,732. Oh, that's a quicker way and confirms the same answer. So that's good. So my initial calculation was correct. Therefore the final product is 315,732.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe product of 317 and 996 is \\boxed{315732}.\n"]
