8,100= 189,333. So the total is 189,333. Hmm, but let me verify using another method, maybe the standard multiplication algorithm.\n\nMultiplying 981 by 193:\n\nFirst, write 981\n\nx 193\n\n------------\n\nMultiply 981 by 3: 2943.\n\nMultiply 981 by 90 (which is 981*9 shifted one position to the left): 88290.\n\nMultiply 981 by 100 (shifted two positions): 98100.\n\nThen add them all together, which gives 2943 +88290 +98100 = 189,333. That's consistent.\n\nWait, but let me do the multiplication in a different way to cross-verify. Maybe using the distributive property:\n\n981 * 193 = 981*(200 -7) = 981*200 - 981*7.\n\nCalculating 981*200: 981*2=1962, so *100=196,200.\n\nThen 981*7: 900*7=6300, 80*7=560, 1*7=7. Total is 6300+560=6860 +7=6867.\n\nSubtract: 196,200 -6,867. Let's compute that.\n\n196,200 - 6,867:\n\n196,200 - 6,000 =190,200\n\n190,200 - 867 = 189,333.\n\nYes, that matches. So the answer is 189,333. Okay, so I think that's correct. I'll go with that.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe product of 981 and 193 is \\boxed{189333}.\n"]
