).\n6 (1,000).\n8 (100).\n0 (10).\n0 (1).\n\nAnd 11808 is:.\n\n0 (100,000).\n1 (10,000).\n1 (1,000).\n8 (100).\n0 (10).\n8 (1).\n\nSo adding them:.\n\nStarting from the rightmost digit (units):.\n\n0 +8 =8  .\n0 +0=0  .\n8 +8 =16 → write 6, carry 1  .\n6 +1 +1 (carry) =8  .\n9 +1 =10 → write 0, carry 1  .\n1 +0 +1 (carry) =2. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
