Wait, but let me confirm once again with another approach. Maybe breaking down the numbers differently?\n\nAlternatively, 222 is 200 +20 +2, so 317*(200+20+2)=317*200 +317*20 +317*2, which is exactly what I did. So 63,400 +6,340 +634 =70,374. Yeah, that seems right. I think that's correct. I don't see any errors in the steps. So the final product is 70,374.\n</think>\n\n",
