ns place), and 127,500 (from the hundreds place). Let me add them step by step. First, 765 + 17,850. Adding those together: 765 + 17,850. Let's see, 17,850 + 700 is 18,550, then +65 is 18,615. Then adding the last part: 18,615 + 127,500. Hmm, 18,615 + 127,500. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
