gain, breaking it down: 224 ×8 ×100. 224×8 we already did as 1792. So 1792 ×100 is 179200. Let me confirm: 224 ×800. 224×8=1792, times 100 gives 179200. Yep.\n\nNow I have to add all three results together: 1568 (from the ones place), 17920 (from the tens place), and 179200 (from the hundreds place). Let me line them up properly:.\n\n   1568.\n+ 17920.\n+179200.\n--------.\n?.\n\nAdding the first two: 1568 + 17920. Let's see, 1568 + 17920. 1568 + 17000 = 18568, then +920 gives 19488? Wait, maybe better step by step. 17920 + 1568. 17920 + 1000 is 18920, then +500 is 19420, then +68 is 19488. Then adding that to 179200: 19488 + 179200. Let's see, 179200 + 19,488. Adding 179,200 + 19,488. 179,200 + 19,000 = 198,200. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
