d to multiply that result by 100. Wait, actually, maybe another way: 424 × 900 is the same as 424 × 9 × 100. So 3816 × 100 = 381,600. Okay, that seems right. .\n\nNow, I need to add all three results together: 424 (from the ones place) + 4240 (from the tens place) + 381,600 (from the hundreds place). Let me do that step by step.\n\nFirst, add the ones and tens place results: 424 + 4240 = 4664. Then add that to 381,600. .\n\n381,600 + 4,664. Let me add 381,600 + 4,000 first, which is 385,600. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
