s 1,120, plus 83 is 1,203. Wait, maybe I should do it more carefully. 13,220 plus 1,983. 13,220 + 1,000 is 14,220, then +983: 14,220 + 900 is 15,120, plus 83 is 15,203. Hmm, maybe I made a mistake there. Let me check again: 13,220 + 1,983. Breaking down:.\n\n13,220 + 1,000 = 14,220.\n\n14,220 + 900 = 15,120.\n\n15,120 + 83 = 15,203. Yeah, that's correct.\n\nThen add that to 462,700. So 15,203 + 462,700. Let's see: 462,700 + 15,000 is 477,700. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
