\n\nNow add all these together:\n\n630,000 +21,000 = 651,000\n\n651,000 +6,300 = 657,300\n\n657,300 +3,600 = 660,900\n\n660,900 +120 = 661,020\n\n661,020 +36 = 661,056.\n\nYes, same result. So that's correct. So the product is indeed 661,056. Alright, so the answer should be 661,056. Let me make sure I didn't make any arithmetic errors here.\n\nWait, in the expanded terms, let's check each term again:\n\n700*900: 700*9=6300, so 700*900=630,000 ✔️\n\n700*30: 700*3=2100 → 21,000 ✔️\n\n700*9=6,300 ✔️\n\n4*900=3,600 ✔️\n\n4*30=120 ✔️\n\n4*9=36 ✔️\n\nAdding them step by step:\n\nStart with 630,000 +21,000 = 651,000\n\nThen add 6,300: 651,000 +6,300 = 657,300\n\nAdd 3,600: 657,300 +3,600 = 660,900\n\nAdd 120: 660,900 +120 = 661,020\n\nAdd 36: 661,020 +36 = 661,056. Yep, correct.\n\nOkay, so I think that's solid. So the answer is 661,056. Therefore, I can fill in the template accordingly.\n"]
