compute 465*8. 400*8=3200, 60*8=480, 5*8=40. Adding those: 3200 + 480 = 3680, plus 40 is 3720. Then add two zeros to make it 372,000. .\n\nNow I have the three partial products: 2,790 (from the ones place), 32,550 (from the tens place), and 372,000 (from the hundreds place). Adding them all together. Let me start with the largest one first. 372,000 plus 32,550 is 404,550. Then adding 2,790 to that. .\n\nWait, 404,550 + 2,790. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
