h is in the tens place, so actually 90) × 504. So 9 × 504 = 4,536. But since it's the tens place, we shift one position: 45,360.\n\nThen the hundreds digit: 7 (in the hundreds place, so 700) × 504 = 7×504=3,528, shifted two positions: 352,800.\n\nAdding them:\n\n504\n\n+45,360\n\n=45,864\n\nThen +352,800:\n\n45,864 + 352,800 = 398,664. Yep, same as before.\n\nSo the answer should be 398,664. I think that's correct. Let me just check with a calculator approximation. 500 × 800 is 400,000. Since 504 is a bit more than 500 and 791 is a bit less than 800, so the actual product should be slightly less than 400,000. 398,664 is 1,336 less, which makes sense because (504-500)=4 and (800-791)=9. So the difference would be 500×9 (4,500) minus 4×791 (3,164), so net difference 1,336. So that matches. Therefore, confident it's correct.\n"]
