nes place digit (5):  \n   \\(799 \\times 5 = 3,\\!995\\).  \n2. Multiply 799 by the tens place digit (80):  \n   \\(799 \\times 80 = 63,\\!920\\).  \n3. Multiply 799 by the hundreds place digit (600):  \n   \\(799 \\times 600 = 479,\\!400\\).  \n\nAnswer:  \nNow, sum all the step results:  \n\\(3,\\!995 + 63,\\!920 + 479,\\!400 = 547,\\!315\\).  \nSo, the final computed product is \\boxed{547315}.",
