ess than 700. So the product should be (800×700) - (800×15 +700×1) + (1×15). Wait, maybe that's overcomplicating. But 800×685 =548,000. Then subtract 1×685 gives 548,000 -685 =547,315. Exactly! That's the same result. So that confirms it. So the final answer should be 547,315.\n\nI think that's correct. All methods cross-check to the same number. So I'm confident.\n"]
