-\nFirst multiply by 4: 253×4=1,012\n\nThen multiply by 40: 253×40=10,120 (as above)\n\nThen multiply by 200: 253×200=50,600\n\nAdd them all: 1,012 +10,120 =11,132; 11,132 +50,600 =61,732.\n\nYes, so all methods give the same result. So I think the answer is 61,732. Wait but let me check once more in case I made a mistake in any step.\n\nWait, 253 × 244. Let me do it in another way: 253 × 244 =253×(200+40+4) which is exactly what I did. So, all steps check out. I think that's correct. So the final answer should be 61,732.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe product of 253 and 244 is \\boxed{61732}.\n"]
