,536. Yep, same answer. So that's correct.\n\nAlternatively, maybe do 728 * 100 =72,800; 728*10=7,280; 728*2=1,456. Then total 72,800 +7,280 is 80,080, plus 1,456 gives 81,536. Yep, same. \n\nSo, looks like the answer is 81,536. \n\nTherefore, following the template, the steps are:\n\n1. Multiply 112 by 8 (ones place) = 896\n\n2. Multiply 112 by 20 (tens place) = 2240\n\n3. Multiply 112 by 700 (hundreds place) =78,400\n\nSum those three: 896 +2240= 3136; 3136+78,400=81,536.\n\nSo the final answer is 81,536. I think that's correct. Let me just check once more with a calculator approach. \n\nWait, 112 multiplied by 700 is 78,400. 112*28 is 112*(20+8)=2240+896=3136. So 78,400 +3,136=81,536. Correct. Alright, confident now.\n"]
