p:\n- First, add \\(2618\\) and \\(26180\\):\n  \\[\n  2618 + 26180 = 28798\n  \\]\n- Then, add the result to \\(299200\\):\n  \\[\n  28798 + 299200 = 327998\n  \\]\n\nThus, the final computed product of 374 and 877 is \\(\\boxed{327998}\\).",
