ndreds place digit 900 of 949:\n   \\[\n   856 \\times 900 = 770400\n   \\]\n\nNow, sum all the step results:\n\\[\n7704 + 34240 + 770400 = 812344\n\\]\n\nSo, the final computed product is \\boxed{812344}.",
