 34 is 30 +4. So 921×30=27,630 and 921×4=3,684. Adding those gives 27,630 + 3,684 = 31,314. Then total is 276,300 + 31,314 = 307,614. Yep, same result.\n\nSo I think that's correct. Maybe I was just overcomplicating, but the answer should be 307,614.\n\nWait, but let me check again the addition steps. When adding 3,684 + 27,630, that's 3,684 + 27,630. Let's add units:\n\n3,684  \n+27,630  \n=?\n\nAligning the numbers:\n\n  3,684  \n+27,630  \n--------\n 31,314\n\nYes, because 3,684 + 27,630: 3,000 + 27,000 = 30,000; 684 + 630 = 1,314. Total is 31,314. Then adding to 276,300:\n\n276,300  \n+31,314  \n=?\n\n276,300 + 31,314:\n\n200,000 + 70,000 +6,300 + 31,314. Hmm, maybe better step by step.\n\n276,300 + 30,000 = 306,300  \n306,300 + 1,314 = 307,614. Correct.\n\nAlright, seems consistent. I think that's the right answer. So the product of 921 and 334 is 307,614.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe product of 921 and 334 is \\boxed{307614}.\n"]
