 multiplying 794 by 536 in another way.\n\nAlternatively, 794 ×536 = (800 -6) ×536 = 800×536 -6×536.\n\nCompute 800×536 = 428,800.\n\n6×536 = 3,216.\n\nSo subtract: 428,800 - 3,216 = ?\n\n428,800 minus 3,216:\n\n428,800 - 3,000 =425,800.\n\nThen subtract 216 more: 425,800 -216 =425,584. Same result. Okay, that's a good check. So that confirms the answer is 425,584.\n\nTherefore, I think the final answer is correct.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe product of 794 and 536 is \\boxed{425584}.\n"]
