,960 and 1*49=49. So total 1,960+49=2,009.\n\nNow add all four terms: 300,000 +29,400 =329,400; 329,400 +20,500 =349,900; 349,900 +2,009 =351,909. So that's the same result. Great, so that confirms it. So the product is indeed 351,909.\n\nTherefore, after verifying through multiple methods, I can be confident the answer is correct.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe product of 641 and 549 is \\boxed{351909}.\n"] 97%|#########7| 486/500 [6:43:54<11:36, 49.75s/it]
