ace digit 50 of 757:  \n   \\(669 \\times 50 = 33450\\).\n3. Multiply 669 by the hundreds place digit 700 of 757:  \n   \\(669 \\times 700 = 468300\\).\n\nSum all the step results:  \n\\(4683 + 33450 + 468300 = 506433\\).\n\nAnswer:  \nNow, sum all the step results: \\(4683 + 33450 + 468300 = 506433\\).  \nSo, the final computed product is \\boxed{506433}.",
